#C  itself generated with the mucal subroutine (P. Bandyopadhyay) from:
#C    W. H. McMaster, N. Kerr Del Grande, J. H. Mallett & J. H. Hubbell (1969),
#C    Compilation of X-ray Cross Sections, UCRL-50174 Sec. II Rev. 1.
