#C    - energy-trimmed to 2-120 keV (lab + synchrotron powder-XRD band)
#C    - columns reduced to PhotonEnergy / Photoelectric / Total
#C      (the photoelectric column is kept to detect absorption-edge
#C       intervals: it is the only component that jumps at an edge)
#C  Elements Z=84,85,87,88,89,91,93 are absent from the McMaster compilation.
#UD Column description:
#UD   1: PhotonEnergy[eV]  2: Photoelectric[barn/atom]  3: Total[barn/atom]
